## 4.3 Trend Mode Analysis

The Cyber Cycle does NOT self-suppress in trend mode. Signal rate in 2022 EUR/USD downtrend (4.9 bars/signal) vs mixed period (4.3 bars/signal) shows only 14% improvement. External regime gate required (MAMA/FAMA spread width).

# 5. Sensitivity Analysis (Day 5)

| **Alpha** | **Cycle Std** | **Crossovers** | **Bars/Signal** |
